 drivers/clk/mediatek/Makefile            |   1 +
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6797-mcusys.c | 860 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 871 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6797-mcusys.c

